<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron downgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cabletron downgraded.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch said it lowered its recommendation on Cabletron Systems Inc to near-term neutral from accumulate.</p>
<p>-- Long-term accumulate rating was left unchanged.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off 14-3/4 to 31 in early third market trade.  The stock was not yet traded on the New York Stock Exchange due to an order imbalance and was indicated at 29 to 32.</p>
<p>-- Additional details on the downgrade were not immediately available.</p>
</text>
